    <body>
        <p><b>Sankskrit Name</b> - Pranamasana</p>
        <p><b>Benefits</b> - Promotes grounding and focus.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">How to Practice</p>
        <ol>
            <li>
                <p>Stand at the front of the mat, feet together.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Bring palms together at the chest in a prayer position.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Inhale deeply and center your mind.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </body>
</html>